<title>UK: Kommuninvest sets $200 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kommuninvest sets $200 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOMMUNINVEST</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    12.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
